WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.873
Records show whether your business is really making money.

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:08.520
Write down every sale and every expense, every day.

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:13.460
Keep business money and personal money separate. Pay yourself a set amount.

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:16.893
Keep receipts, and save mobile money messages.

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:22.343
Each week, money in minus money out tells you your profit.

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:35.508
Before you move on, check: Start a daily money in and money out book. Keep business and personal money separate. Save receipts and mobile money messages. Work out this week's profit.

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:39.410
In the next lesson: Your one-page plan.
